  "intro": "A fullstack developer must be able to connect a React frontend to a Spring Boot backend without being blocked by CORS errors, serialisation mismatches, or unhandled error states. This module covers every friction point in that connection — from HTTP verb semantics and fetch vs axios trade-offs to configuring CORS in Spring Boot and showing meaningful loading states to users. Master these topics and you will sail through the integration round of any fresher interview."
